# Analysis Notes

## Acrylic Wi-Fi Sniffer

The original report states that Acrylic was used to place the Wi-Fi adapter into monitor mode and help Wireshark see wireless packets.

The report also notes that Acrylic displayed nearby networks and their signal/connectivity information.

## Wireshark

The original report describes Wireshark as the packet-capture and analysis tool. The student noted that Wireshark initially felt more confusing and less structured than Acrylic.

